      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04149",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "古歌：“独自闻鹃不忍听，听时惹起我悲情。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "An old poem says: Alone, I cannot bear to listen to the cuckoo; whenever I hear it, it stirs up my sorrow.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04149",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "愿君飞傍姐儿宅，我欲和她共赏音。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I wish you would fly beside my beloved's house, for I want to enjoy its song together with her.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04149",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "见《河海抄》。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This appears in The Kakaisho.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
